  "title": {
   "en": "Slime wa Saikyoutaru Kanousei wo Himete iru ~2-kai-me no Jinsei, Chanto Slime to Mukiaimasu~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "スライムは最強たる可能性を秘めている～２回目の人生、ちゃんとスライムと向き合います～@COMIC"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Slime wa Saikyoutaru Kanousei o Himete iru ~2-kai-me no Jinsei, Chanto Slime to Mukiaimasu~"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Slime has the Potential to Be the Strongest: In My Second Life, I'll Properly Face My Slime"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In a world where one's entire life is determined by contracts with magical beasts, Zeke, a pauper who formed a contract with the weakest of them all - a Slime - lived a life filled with regret and scorn from those around him. He eventually grew old and met a despairing end... or so he thought, until he found himself regressed to his childhood! Determined to give [Fios] - the only partner he truly connected with in his previous life - a better fate this time, Zeke resolves to turn his life around. Aiming to rise from a slum cleaner to the head of a grand merchant association, he sets his sights on the slime's ability to dissolve anything. What's more, it seems his slime partner also possesses a hidden power...?",
   "ja": "魔獣契約が一生を決定づける世界。最弱【スライム】と契約した貧民・ジケの一生は、後悔と周囲からの蔑みばかり。\n\nついには年老いて失意の最期を迎えた……はずが、子供時代に逆戻り!?\n\n前世で唯一心通わせた相棒【フィオス】に今度こそは良い思いをと、人生逆転を決意する！\n\nスラムの清掃員から大商会長へ成り上がるため目を付けたのはスライムの“何でも溶かす能力”。しかも彼には“秘められた力”もあるようで……？"
  },
